   "kind": "line",
   "speaker": "narration",
   "channel": "narration",
   "text": "Two weeks later, Crimson hosts its masquerade. You’re helping with check-in. Chloe has lent Sophie a red dress. Luna has received an invitation to meet a professor about Elena.",
